  textoPT: 'Eu a vejo me olhando pelas paredes.

    Ela sabe que eu sei.

    Eu
    sei que ela sabe.


    eu fiz aquilo por amor.'
  textoEN: 'I see her watching me through the walls.

    She knows that I know.

    I
    know that she knows.


    I did it for love.'
