  textoPT: "Eu n\xE3o sei se \xE9 poss\xEDvel sair daqui, qual poderia ser a combina\xE7\xE3o?
    Talvez tenha algo a ver com ela... N\xE3o tenho mais for\xE7as para pensar.\n\nPor
    que o dem\xF4nio n\xE3o me leva logo?"
  textoEN: 'I don''t know if it''s possible to get out of here, what could the combination
    be? Maybe it has something to do with her... I have no strength left to think.


    Why
    doesn''t the Demon just take me already?'
